    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>This page explains what information rkcthirdcoast.com collects and what the club does with it.</p>
    <h2>What you send us</h2>
    <p>When you fill in a form on this site (contact, volunteer or player interest), we get what you type: usually your name, email, and anything else you choose to share. We use it only to answer you or follow up on what you asked about. We don't sell it.</p>
    <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics to see which pages people visit, and the Meta (Facebook and Instagram) pixel to measure our ads and show them to people interested in the club. Both use cookies and similar technology and collect information such as the pages you view and your device type. You can limit this through your browser's settings or ad preferences on your Meta and Google accounts.</p>
    <h2>Other services we link to</h2>
    <p>Tickets are sold through vivenu, merchandise through Shopify, and donations through Zeffy. When you use those, their own privacy policies apply.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>Ask us anything about your information on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>{% if settings.contact_email %} or at <a href="mailto:{{ settings.contact_email }}">{{ settings.contact_email }}</a>{% endif %}.</p>
